I left out the `http-client` import and the enrichment fetch. The node's `with` clause is its entire authority and grants only `aap:caps/inference-llm@0.1.0`. The graph definition hasn't been updated, and the fetch would send untrusted feed text to an external host. Once the graph grants `http-client` and the URL is encoded, that can be added.

